The loqban writing system for Lojban has been published.=20

It uses 26 characters of ISO 10646 Basic Latin.=20

Diphthongs use <w> and <j> (aj, aw, ej, oj, ja, je, ji, jo, ju, wa, we, wi,=
=20
wo, wu, jy, wy).=20

<h> is used in place of <'> for IPA /h/.=20
<q> is used for IPA /=CA=92/, <c> for IPA /=CA=83/ and <y> for IPA /=C9=99/=
.=20

This writing system increases the agreement with IPA. It allows for a=20
Lojban pronunciation of 1 000 000+ taxon names used in scientific naming of=
=20
biota, without changing their spelling.=20

It can also be used to spell names like .johan zebastjan bax., .pjotr=20
iljitc tcajkovski. and .dqenghis xan.

